<section class="hero" id="p001" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>{% if settings.band_product.metafields.custom.imagery_approved.value == true %}P001 / Sport Band{% else %}P001 / Prototype 001{% endif %}</p><div class="hero-content"><h1 id="hero-title">{{ section.settings.heading | escape | newline_to_br }}</h1><div class="hero-aside"><p>P001 Sport Band. Designed to help athletes with an ostomy focus on what they love.</p>{% if settings.enable_purchasing %}
<a class="text-link submit" href="{% if settings.band_product != blank %}{{ settings.band_product.url }}{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}collections/shop{% endif %}">Shop now <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
{% elsif settings.enable_newsletter %}
<p class="eyebrow">Coming soon</p>
<a class="text-link submit" href="#updates-footer">Join the newsletter <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
{% else %}
<p class="eyebrow">Coming soon</p>
{% endif %}</div></div><div class="product-stage"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="{{ 'product-woven-640.webp' | asset_url }} 640w, {{ 'product-woven-1100.webp' | asset_url }} 1100w, {{ 'product-woven-1672.webp' | asset_url }} 1672w" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 82vw"><img src="{{ 'product-woven.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1672" height="941" alt="P001 sport band concept in black with a subtle Volt accent" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></picture></div><p class="image-caption"><span>P001 / Sport band</span>{% unless settings.band_product.metafields.custom.imagery_approved.value == true %}<span>Prototype / Concept visualization</span>{% endunless %}</p></section>
<section class="mission" id="our-story" aria-labelledby="mission-title" data-mission-scene><div class="section-label"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>Our mission</p><span class="section-no">ELEVEN / FORWARD</span></div><h2 id="mission-title"><span class="mission-line">A life-saving surgery</span> <span class="mission-line">should not limit</span> <span class="mission-line mission-final">an active life.</span></h2><div class="mission-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div></section>
<section class="founder" aria-labelledby="founder-title" data-founder-scene><div class="founder-portrait"><picture class="founder-picture"><source type="image/webp" srcset="{{ 'founder-neutral-480.webp' | asset_url }} 480w, {{ 'founder-neutral-768.webp' | asset_url }} 768w, {{ 'founder-neutral-1100.webp' | asset_url }} 1100w, {{ 'founder-neutral-1650.webp' | asset_url }} 1650w" sizes="(max-width: 615px) 616px, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1547px) 774px, 50vw"><img class="founder-image" src="{{ 'founder-neutral.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1650" height="1152" alt="Manning Price, founder of Eleven Forward" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture><span class="portrait-label">Manning Price / Founder</span></div><div class="founder-copy"><div class="founder-light" aria-hidden="true"></div><p class="eyebrow">Lived experience</p><h2 id="founder-title">Surviving was<br>the beginning.</h2><p>Founded by Manning Price, an ostomy survivor building an athletic brand around life beyond surgery.</p></div></section>
<section class="club-invitation" aria-labelledby="invitation-title"><div class="invitation-image"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="{{ 'club-black-front-cutout-480.webp' | asset_url }} 480w, {{ 'club-black-front-cutout-800.webp' | asset_url }} 800w, {{ 'club-black-front-cutout-1200.webp' | asset_url }} 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 90vw, (max-width: 900px) 85vw, 62vw"><img src="{{ 'club-black-front-cutout.png' | asset_url }}" width="1254" height="1254" alt="Black Survival Club tee front on the supplier-reference cut. Design concept." loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="{{ 'club-black-back-cutout-480.webp' | asset_url }} 480w, {{ 'club-black-back-cutout-800.webp' | asset_url }} 800w, {{ 'club-black-back-cutout-1200.webp' | asset_url }} 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 90vw, (max-width: 900px) 85vw, 62vw"><img src="{{ 'club-black-back-cutout.png' | asset_url }}" width="1254" height="1254" alt="Black Survival Club tee back graphic on the supplier-reference cut. Design concept." loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture></div><div class="invitation-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>Wear the belief</p><h2 id="invitation-title">Survival Club.</h2><p>The culture behind Eleven Forward. Wear the spirit of a community moving forward together.</p><a class="text-link submit button-secondary" href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/survival-club">Shop Survival Club <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></section>
<section class="brand" aria-labelledby="mark-title"><div class="section-label"><h2 class="eyebrow" id="mark-title">Mark of the Survivors</h2><span class="section-no">11° FORWARD</span></div><div class="brand-layout" data-mark-story><div class="brand-symbol mark-stage"><svg class="mark-motion-svg" viewBox="-30 -75 210 225" role="img" aria-labelledby="motion-mark-title"><title id="motion-mark-title">Eleven Forward: two ascending forms</title><defs><clipPath id="mark-reveal"><rect data-mark-reveal x="-20" y="-20" width="200" height="140"/></clipPath><mask id="guide-small" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x="-30" y="-75" width="210" height="225"><path data-mark-draw="diagonal" d="M-12.1 132L27.85 10" pathLength="1" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="4"/></mask><mask id="guide-tall-left" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x="-30" y="-75" width="210" height="225"><path data-mark-draw="diagonal" d="M47.21 125L94.53 -20" pathLength="1" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="4"/></mask><mask id="guide-tall-right" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x="-30" y="-75" width="210" height="225"><path data-mark-draw="diagonal" d="M104.45 112L147.53 -20" pathLength="1" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="4"/></mask><mask id="guide-small-vertical" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x="-30" y="-75" width="210" height="225"><path data-mark-draw="reference" d="M19 117V-27" pathLength="1" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="4"/></mask><mask id="guide-tall-vertical" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x="-30" y="-75" width="210" height="225"><path data-mark-draw="reference" d="M88 112V-73" pathLength="1" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="4"/></mask><mask id="guide-baseline" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x="-30" y="-75" width="210" height="225"><path data-mark-draw="reference" d="M-22 95H161" pathLength="1" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="4"/></mask><mask id="guide-small-angle" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x="-30" y="-75" width="210" height="225"><path data-mark-draw="arc" d="M19 12A25 25 0 0 1 26.78 13.24" pathLength="1" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="4"/></mask><mask id="guide-tall-angle" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x="-30" y="-75" width="210" height="225"><path data-mark-draw="arc" d="M88 -25A25 25 0 0 1 95.76 -23.76" pathLength="1" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="4"/></mask></defs><g clip-path="url(#mark-reveal)" fill="currentColor"><path data-mark-small d="M0 95 19 37H66L47 95Z"/><path data-mark-tall d="M57 95 88 0H141L110 95Z"/></g><g class="mark-guides" data-mark-guides aria-hidden="true" fill="none"><path class="mark-stem-guide" d="M-12.1 132L27.85 10" mask="url(#guide-small)"/><path class="mark-stem-guide" d="M47.21 125L94.53 -20" mask="url(#guide-tall-left)"/><path class="mark-stem-guide" d="M104.45 112L147.53 -20" mask="url(#guide-tall-right)"/><path class="mark-reference" d="M19 117V-27" mask="url(#guide-small-vertical)"/><path class="mark-reference" d="M88 112V-73" mask="url(#guide-tall-vertical)"/><path class="mark-reference" d="M-22 95H161" mask="url(#guide-baseline)"/><path class="mark-angle-arc" d="M19 12A25 25 0 0 1 26.78 13.24" mask="url(#guide-small-angle)"/><path class="mark-angle-arc" d="M88 -25A25 25 0 0 1 95.76 -23.76" mask="url(#guide-tall-angle)"/><g data-mark-angle class="mark-angle-construction"><text x="13" y="8" text-anchor="end" class="mark-angle-label">11°</text><text x="82" y="-29" text-anchor="end" class="mark-angle-label">11°</text><text x="70" y="141" text-anchor="middle" class="mark-concept-label">11° / Brand concept</text></g></g><g class="mark-direction" data-mark-direction aria-hidden="true" fill="none"><path data-mark-arrow pathLength="1" d="M7 20L158 -34"/><path data-mark-arrowhead d="M145 -37L158 -34L150 -23"/></g><text data-mark-date class="mark-date" x="70" y="130" text-anchor="middle" aria-hidden="true">11</text></svg><p class="mark-scroll-hint" aria-hidden="true">Scroll to explore <span>↓</span></p></div><ol class="meaning"><li><span class="number">11</span><span>The 11 honors Manning’s surgery date, the 11th. “Forward” represents life beyond that day: resilience, possibility, and the freedom to keep moving.</span></li><li><span class="number">11°</span><span>The icon and wordmark share an 11° forward lean, expressing movement and momentum. It’s a reminder to keep looking ahead.</span></li><li><span class="number">Better things ahead</span><span>The mark points up and to the right, a reminder that better things lie ahead. Wherever we are in the journey, we keep moving forward together.</span></li><li><span class="number">Always Next Step Forward</span><span>Two ascending forms represent steps forward, with progress built one step at a time. Flat edges bring clarity and control.</span></li></ol></div></section>
